# Act I: the regulars' wager
# Stamping the betting slate (rooms.ts, tavern) opens here.
dialogue regulars
  node slate narrator "I bring the harbour stamp down on the betting slate, under SHE COMES BACK. Three years' wages, witnessed by me."
    -> book
  node book regular "A clerk betting on pirates! Put it in the book, Marta, before he sobers up."
    > "I am entirely sober. So is the stamp." -> sober
      set wager
    > "Put me down for the first round." -> round
      set wager
  node sober regular "Sober and stamped. Gods help us, lads, it's binding."
  node round regular "He's buying a round on a ghost ship! Marta, chalk it up. If she comes back, we drink it. If she doesn't, we drink it anyway, sadly."
